# StaySafe Online 🛡️
<p align="center">
    <img src="images/logo.png" alt="StaySafe Online Logo" width="120" />
</p>

**StaySafe Online** empowers everyone to browse the internet safely and confidently.  
Discover essential resources, actionable tips, and trusted tools to protect your digital life.

---

## 🌐 Live Demo

[🚀 Try StaySafe Online](https://anandksri.github.io/staysafe-online)

---

## ✨ Key Features

- 📚 **Learn**: Easy-to-understand guides on online safety
- 💡 **Tips**: Interactive best practices for secure browsing
- 🛡️ **Threats Explained**: Clear breakdowns of common cyber risks
- 🧰 **Toolbox**: Curated cybersecurity tools you can trust
- 📰 **News & Alerts**: Stay updated with the latest in cybersecurity
- 🎬 **Smooth Experience**: Typing animations & smooth scrolling
- 📱 **Responsive Design**: Looks great on any device
- 🔍 **SEO Optimized**: Enhanced discoverability with meta tags, Open Graph, and Schema
- ♿ **Accessible**: ARIA roles, keyboard navigation, and more
- 🌟 **PWA Ready**: Favicon support & installable manifest

